{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fishbait</strong> is a casual 2-4 player card game about survival where the last fish standing wins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2001860/extras/dafc36e0d7897e2cf7a86cd24f97961e.poster.avif?t=1763423229\" width=1080 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2001860/extras/dafc36e0d7897e2cf7a86cd24f97961e.webm?t=1763423229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2001860/extras/dafc36e0d7897e2cf7a86cd24f97961e.mp4?t=1763423229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rules of the game are simple. There are several &quot;bait&quot; cards hidden in the deck, and when you draw them, you will get caught by the fisherman. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2001860/extras/628489831d4dc8ac633664b559c02cb2.poster.avif?t=1763423229\" width=780 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2001860/extras/628489831d4dc8ac633664b559c02cb2.webm?t=1763423229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are over 10+ fish avatars that you can choose from, and each of them have a unique personality.\u00a0<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2001860/extras/1ac2f3d272a94e5cbf8dc7830b349e8d.avif?t=1763423229\" width=973 height=312 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each turn, you place as many action cards as you can and drawing a card from the deck will end your turn. You can use a &quot;Favor&quot; card to get a card from an enemy, a &quot;Dig&quot; card to draw from the bottom pile of the deck, a &quot;Look&quot; card to see the top 3 cards, &quot;Skip&quot; to skip your turn, &quot;Escape&quot; to escape from fisherman when you get caught.\u00a0<br><br>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2001860/extras/0cf1dae9e1852a79ea4bcde676b612d7.avif?t=1763423229\" width=780 height=289 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2001860?t=1763423229","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2001860?t=1763423229","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2001860/4afd814775c5f51f0555412edb7c4a99ef151f9e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763423229","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2001860/4afd814775c5f51f0555412edb7c4a99ef151f9e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763423229","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fishbait</strong> is a casual 2-4 player card game about survival where the last fish standing wins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2001860/extras/dafc36e0d7897e2cf7a86cd24f97961e.poster.avif?t=1763423229\" width=1080 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2001860/extras/dafc36e0d7897e2cf7a86cd24f97961e.webm?t=1763423229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2001860/extras/dafc36e0d7897e2cf7a86cd24f97961e.mp4?t=1763423229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rules of the game are simple. There are several &quot;bait&quot; cards hidden in the deck, and when you draw them, you will get caught by the fisherman. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2001860/extras/628489831d4dc8ac633664b559c02cb2.poster.avif?t=1763423229\" width=780 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2001860/extras/628489831d4dc8ac633664b559c02cb2.webm?t=1763423229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are over 10+ fish avatars that you can choose from, and each of them have a unique personality.\u00a0<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2001860/extras/1ac2f3d272a94e5cbf8dc7830b349e8d.avif?t=1763423229\" width=973 height=312 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each turn, you place as many action cards as you can and drawing a card from the deck will end your turn. You can use a &quot;Favor&quot; card to get a card from an enemy, a &quot;Dig&quot; card to draw from the bottom pile of the deck, a &quot;Look&quot; card to see the top 3 cards, &quot;Skip&quot; to skip your turn, &quot;Escape&quot; to escape from fisherman when you get caught.\u00a0<br><br>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2001860/extras/0cf1dae9e1852a79ea4bcde676b612d7.avif?t=1763423229\" width=780 height=289 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Yomu Labs"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2001860/31cfb50d8afaa2818e7a87bbd1a4a863fe593af1/header.jpg?t=1763423229","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 11 (Big Sur) or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 or higher<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 4000 or higher<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 100 MB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2001860/112055643/9d482440636892a3957734f15ecd87847bb3cf54/1762973908/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762974535","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2001860/112055643/9d482440636892a3957734f15ecd87847bb3cf54/1762973908/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762974535","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2001860/112055643/9d482440636892a3957734f15ecd87847bb3cf54/1762973908/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1762974535","id":257230157,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steams